# Icons Directory

This directory will contain PWA icons. The following files need to be generated:

- icon-192x192.png (192x192 px)
- icon-512x512.png (512x512 px)
- icon-maskable-192x192.png (192x192 px, maskable)
- icon-maskable-512x512.png (512x512 px, maskable)
- apple-touch-icon.png (180x180 px)

Generate these from the L'Alternativa logo with appropriate padding for maskable icons.
